WEBVTT

00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:04.350
I can't believe it!

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:07.770
The vice-general Balflear has forfeited the sixth match!

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.940
It's their victory by default!

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:12.390
However, worry not!

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:13.510
Because...

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:16.950
we have His Majesty Leohart with us!

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.040
Leohart is...

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:21.040
But Basara-sama still hasn't...

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:22.540
Don't worry.

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:24.540
Basara will return.

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:26.990
I'm sure he'll be back.

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:10.820
<i>So Jin Toujou's son isn't showing up, huh?</i>

00:02:10.820 --> 00:02:13.520
<i>Still, I couldn't ask for a better opponent.</i>

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:15.620
<i>I'll defeat him with my own two hands.</i>

00:02:15.620 --> 00:02:17.530
<i>I'll cut down these ghosts of the past,</i>

00:02:18.020 --> 00:02:23.780
<i>and show the entire demon realm who's truly fit to be their Demon Lord.</i>

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:28.070
<i>I'll win this battle, no matter what. Then...</i>

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:34.620
How is he able to enter Xamdu?!

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:35.650
Don't panic.

00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:36.510
Oh?!

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:41.010
He probably broke through the barrier
 using that elimination technique of his.

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:48.520
All right!

00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:51.520
The time has finally arrived!{The moment is finally here!}

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:57.210
Our Great Majesty, the Demon Lord, is here to unite the demon realm!

00:02:57.210 --> 00:03:01.780
He's going to show these foolish upstarts true fear and despair

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:04.520
before sending them to depths of hell—!

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:04.520
Get lost.

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:10.040
Let's start this.

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:11.140
Yeah.

00:03:36.410 --> 00:03:39.070
You're not going to watch your son's battle?{Are these called battles? Fights? "while your son's fighting" doesn't flow with next line, so it needs to be called some sort of event. - Editor}

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:42.610
Watching it isn't going to change the outcome, is it?

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:44.510
What's with that?

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:48.080
Do you think he can beat His Majesty or something?

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:54.900
Well, as his father, I want to believe in my cute little boy's victory.  {We used: "my cute little boy" previously, ep6 @ 15min32s, but the context was different, editor make a choice.}{Cute little boy sounded more natural to me overall, so keeping it. - Editor}

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:59.210
But the chances of Basara winning are one in five at best.

00:04:40.430 --> 00:04:41.510
This smell...

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:54.060
Amazing! Amazing!

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:57.380
But on the other hand, that's all he has.

00:04:58.100 --> 00:05:01.860
Banishing Shift always creates an opening.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:06.860
Against Leohart, that brief opening could prove fatal.

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:11.820
Basara-sama wants to use Banishing Shift, but can't.

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:13.620
N-No way...

00:05:15.420 --> 00:05:18.630
Don't worry. Basara won't lose.

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:31.130
Hmph, I see...

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:34.270
He's using the perfume to make me see those doubles.

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:39.850
But each blow's too light.

00:05:45.590 --> 00:05:48.280
Are you hiding something up your sleeve, Basacchi?

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:27.940
A technique that uses the dimensional 
distortion from drawing your sword, huh?

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:32.160
It's not a bad idea, but by its nature,

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:34.500
I can always see when you're about to use it.

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:41.580
Your mistake was to let Gald see it.

00:06:52.770 --> 00:06:54.610
Basara-sama's movements are...

00:06:54.610 --> 00:06:56.850
It's like he's covering something.

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:57.720
No way!

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:04.280
Basara!

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:09.650
I won't let you!

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.910
Howl! Loki!

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:49.530
Farewell, son of the war god.

00:07:56.260 --> 00:08:00.530
It's true this could unleash the demon power hidden within you, Basara-kun.

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:05.790
It could unleash your other mother's blood.

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:07.280
But,

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:09.020
I don't know what will happen after that.{from it.}

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:10.450
I understand.

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:13.300
But this is the only option I have.

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:15.320
So, please.

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:19.240
<i>Even</i>

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:22.760
<i>if I stop being myself,</i>

00:08:22.760 --> 00:08:23.600
<i>I'll...</i>

00:08:24.380 --> 00:08:26.310
<i>I'll protect everyone!</i>

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:35.070
Basara!

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:48.100
<i>Next it's your turn, councilmen.</i>

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:12.520
That's a Demon Lord's...

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:16.780
You mean he didn't break through this barrier...

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:39.390
So this was his trump card?!

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:52.400
That fearsome power is destroying his own flesh, too.

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:55.900
At this rate, his body won't hold out!

00:09:57.900 --> 00:09:59.260
No way!

00:09:59.260 --> 00:10:00.200
Basara!

00:10:25.610 --> 00:10:27.430
No! Basara!

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:30.940
Mio-sama!

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:32.260
You mustn't!

00:10:38.890 --> 00:10:40.670
<i>Take care of Basara.</i>

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:06.960
Basara!

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:35.680
Huh?

00:11:56.890 --> 00:11:59.010
Now I'm at school?

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:01.110
Why?

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:08.850
Oh, no!

00:12:23.310 --> 00:12:24.160
Huh?

00:12:27.350 --> 00:12:28.850
Mio-sama!

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:31.350
Why, you!

00:12:38.550 --> 00:12:40.730
This is our city.

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:44.020
I see.

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:46.460
This is the inside of Basara's mind.

00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:56.870
<i>The rampant power is trying to devour Basara's soul, too!</i>

00:12:56.870 --> 00:12:59.630
<i>I can't allow that to happen, no matter what!</i>

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:04.850
<i>Basara, where are you?</i>

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:12.450
Basara!

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:22.110
<i>Basara?</i>

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:24.120
<i>Where are you, Basara?</i>

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:31.590
There!

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:36.750
Beat it!

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:41.500
Basara!

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:43.360
Basara!

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:45.260
Basara!

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:53.310
Basara, where are you?!

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:07.820
This time, the power sleeping within you will be mine!

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:09.820
Why, you!

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:36.350
<i>Basara!</i>

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:40.360
You...!

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:51.520
Basara!

00:14:57.520 --> 00:14:58.410
Basara...

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:10.680
Basara!

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:43.330
Basara...

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:51.840
Mio...

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:55.720
Mio...

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:06.610
I'm sorry for forcing you to push yourself this much.

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:23.000
Onii-chan!

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:31.490
It's fine.

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:33.980
Do what you want to me.

00:16:35.020 --> 00:16:37.890
So please, come back to me.

00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:45.270
I love you, Onii-chan.

00:17:00.270 --> 00:17:01.160
Mio...

00:17:02.440 --> 00:17:03.660
Basara...

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:13.750
Mio, I'm sorry...

00:17:14.740 --> 00:17:17.060
for making you put yourself in such danger.

00:17:17.060 --> 00:17:18.140
It's fine.

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:23.470
After all, you told me to believe in you, 
no matter what happened.

00:17:52.380 --> 00:17:55.110
Basara-sama, thank goodness!

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:56.750
Thank you, Mio.

00:18:01.670 --> 00:18:03.260
What?!

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:05.120
What's the meaning of this?!

00:18:05.120 --> 00:18:06.730
Lord Belphegor is—!

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:08.440
Stay calm!

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:11.290
We still have the ultimate trump card.

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:15.780
Awaken, King of Heroic Spirits.

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:22.030
Th-That's...

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:33.350
What is that?

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:35.470
A-A heroic spirit?

00:18:35.470 --> 00:18:37.160
The demon, Chaos.

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:38.050
"Chaos"?

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:40.820
I've heard of him in legends.

00:18:40.820 --> 00:18:44.060
He's the supreme being that 
reigns over all heroic spirits—

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:47.540
The demon known as the flames of purgatory.

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:54.070
He should be satisfied with the son of 
that war god, the reigning Demon Lord,

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:58.210
and the former Demon Lord's daughter as the sacrifices put before him.

00:18:58.930 --> 00:19:01.380
Eat to your heart's content, Chaos.

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:11.080
Basara-sama!

00:19:13.580 --> 00:19:15.720
You wiped them out{cleared them away} already?

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:19.470
Now the demon realm will undoubtedly be ours.

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:21.450
You think so?

00:19:21.450 --> 00:19:25.940
There's still Ramsus and other nuisances left to deal with.

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:27.100
Have you forgotten?

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:30.460
That demon, Chaos, is the King of Heroic Spirits.{The demon Chaos is the King of Heroic Spirits.}

00:19:30.460 --> 00:19:33.750
He can command any number of heroic spirits.

00:19:57.440 --> 00:19:59.130
With his power in our hands,

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:02.380
it will be easy for us to exterminate any lingering enemies.

00:20:04.980 --> 00:20:06.670
We have an emergency.

00:20:06.670 --> 00:20:07.390
What is it?

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:11.390
Chaos won't stop summoning heroic spirits.

00:20:12.950 --> 00:20:14.110
What's that?

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:31.260
If we continue to keep Chaos active,

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:33.830
the entire demon realm will be razed to the ground.

00:20:34.890 --> 00:20:36.100
So what?

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:37.170
Huh?

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:43.070
It's a good test of ability in preparation for our coming war against gods, is it not?{isn't it?}

00:20:43.070 --> 00:20:44.230
Indeed.

00:20:44.230 --> 00:20:46.220
So long as we remain safe,

00:20:46.220 --> 00:20:48.680
we can rebuild the demon realm as many times as needed.

00:20:48.680 --> 00:20:50.910
I see. It's an honorable sacrifice.

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:53.840
What? Please reconsider this!

00:20:53.840 --> 00:20:54.740
Please!

00:21:01.640 --> 00:21:04.680
That reminds me.
 We haven't seen the Viscount in a while.

00:21:05.420 --> 00:21:09.250
Admirath left to take care of some final loose ends.

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:10.860
He's hopeless.

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:19.180
Oh?

00:21:19.180 --> 00:21:23.770
So he countered the explosion with that elimination technique of his.

00:21:23.770 --> 00:21:27.250
However, how long can he last with those injuries?

00:21:31.420 --> 00:21:32.370
This way!

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:39.730
What on earth?

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:42.450
I'm worried about Ramsus-sama, as well.

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:43.730
I'll go check on him.

00:21:44.180 --> 00:21:46.470
There's no need.

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:49.990
You're all going to die here, after all.
